# 高频词汇 List05
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2026恋练有词
# 描述: 高频词汇List05核心词汇

impose /ɪmˈpəʊz/ v. 施加 The government imposed stricter regulations. 政府实施了更严格的规定。
incentive /ɪnˈsentɪv/ n. 激励 Tax breaks serve as incentives for investment. 减税作为投资的激励。
indicate /ˈɪndɪkeɪt/ v. 表明 The survey indicates a change in attitudes. 调查表明态度发生了变化。
individual /ˌɪndɪˈvɪdʒuəl/ n./adj. 个人 Each individual is responsible for their own choices. 每个人对自己的选择负责。
inevitable /ɪnˈevɪtəbl/ adj. 不可避免的 Change is inevitable in a globalized world. 在全球化世界中，变化是不可避免的。
influence /ˈɪnfluəns/ n./v. 影响 Education has a lasting influence on society. 教育对社会有持久的影响。
infrastructure /ˈɪnfrəstrʌktʃə(r)/ n. 基础设施 Investment in infrastructure boosts economic growth. 基础设施投资促进经济增长。
initial /ɪˈnɪʃəl/ adj. 最初的 The initial phase of the project is complete. 项目的初始阶段已经完成。
innovation /ˌɪnəˈveɪʃn/ n. 创新 Innovation drives economic development. 创新驱动经济发展。
instance /ˈɪnstəns/ n. 实例 In this instance, the rule does not apply. 在这种情况下，该规则不适用。
integrate /ˈɪntɪɡreɪt/ v. 整合 The school integrates technology into the curriculum. 学校将技术整合到课程中。
intelligence /ɪnˈtelɪdʒəns/ n. 智力 Artificial intelligence is reshaping industries. 人工智能正在重塑各个行业。
intense /ɪnˈtens/ adj. 激烈的 The competition for university places is intense. 大学入学竞争非常激烈。
interact /ˌɪntərˈækt/ v. 互动 Researchers study how genes interact with the environment. 研究人员研究基因如何与环境互动。
interpret /ɪnˈtɜːprɪt/ v. 解释 The data can be interpreted in different ways. 数据可以用不同的方式解释。
intervene /ˌɪntəˈviːn/ v. 干预 The government intervened to stabilize the market. 政府进行了干预以稳定市场。
investigate /ɪnˈvestɪɡeɪt/ v. 调查 Scientists are investigating the cause of the outbreak. 科学家正在调查爆发的原因。
involve /ɪnˈvɒlv/ v. 涉及 The project involves collaboration between departments. 该项目涉及部门之间的合作。
isolate /ˈaɪsəleɪt/ v. 隔离 Researchers isolated the virus in the laboratory. 研究人员在实验室中分离出了病毒。
justify /ˈdʒʌstɪfaɪ/ v. 证明…正当 The benefits justify the costs. 好处证明了成本是值得的。
launch /lɔːntʃ/ v./n. 发起 The company launched a new marketing campaign. 公司发起了一场新的营销活动。
maintain /meɪnˈteɪn/ v. 维持 We must maintain high quality standards. 我们必须保持高质量标准。
manipulate /məˈnɪpjuleɪt/ v. 操纵 The data was manipulated to support the conclusion. 数据被操纵以支持结论。
mechanism /ˈmekənɪzəm/ n. 机制 The market has a self-correcting mechanism. 市场有自我纠正机制。
media /ˈmiːdiə/ n. 媒体 Social media has transformed communication. 社交媒体改变了沟通方式。
modify /ˈmɒdɪfaɪ/ v. 修改 The plan was modified to address concerns. 该计划被修改以解决关切。
monitor /ˈmɒnɪtə(r)/ v./n. 监控 The system monitors energy consumption in real time. 该系统实时监控能源消耗。
moreover /mɔːrˈəʊvə(r)/ adv. 此外 The method is effective; moreover, it is cost-efficient. 该方法有效；此外，它还具有成本效益。
negotiate /nɪˈɡəʊʃieɪt/ v. 协商 The parties negotiated a new agreement. 各方协商了一项新协议。
network /ˈnetwɜːk/ n./v. 网络 Building a professional network is essential. 建立专业网络至关重要。
